# System Architecture

Version: 1.0
Status: Draft

---

# Purpose

This document describes the proposed technical architecture for the Speaking Portfolio System.

The design prioritizes:

- Low development cost
- Rapid deployment
- Minimal university IT involvement
- Microsoft 365 integration
- Scalability to at least 800 students
- Future extensibility

---

# Architecture Overview

The application will be implemented primarily within the Microsoft 365 ecosystem using SharePoint Online.

High-level architecture:

```text
┌─────────────────────┐
│     Student         │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ SharePoint Online   │
│ SPFx React App      │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ SharePoint Lists    │
│ (Application Data)  │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Document Library    │
│ (Audio Storage)     │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Power Automate      │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Speech-to-Text API  │
└──────────┬──────────┘
           │
           ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Transcript Stored   │
│ in SharePoint       │
└─────────────────────┘
```

