# Design Principles

## Principle 1

Use existing Microsoft 365 infrastructure wherever possible.

Reason:

- Already available
- Already authenticated
- Already supported by the university

---

## Principle 2

Avoid requiring university-managed cloud infrastructure during MVP development.

Reason:

- Faster development
- Fewer approval delays
- Lower dependency on central IT

---

## Principle 3

Store business data inside SharePoint.

Reason:

- Simplifies deployment
- Eliminates database administration
- Supports reporting requirements

---

## Principle 4

Use external speech-to-text providers when appropriate.

Reason:

- Faster implementation
- Independent billing
- No Azure approval required

