# File Storage Layer

## SharePoint Document Library

Purpose:

Store uploaded audio files.

Recommended structure:

```text
Audio Library

Year
└── Semester
    └── Class
        └── Assignment
            └── Student Audio
```

Example:

```text
2026
└── Spring
    └── ENG101
        └── Travel Conversation
            └── robert.m4a
```

