# Speech-to-Text Provider Abstraction

The application should not depend on a single provider.

A provider abstraction layer should be designed.

Supported providers may include:

```text
Deepgram
OpenAI Whisper
Azure Speech
Future Providers
```

---

## Provider Interface

The application should expect:

Input:

```text
Audio File
```

Output:

```text
Transcript Text
Confidence Data (optional)
Processing Status
```

---

# Metrics Engine

## Purpose

Generate speaking participation metrics.

---

## Word Count

Calculation:

```text
Count all words in transcript.
```

Stored field:

```text
Word Count
```

---

## Turn Count

Calculation:

```text
Count each line of transcript.
```

Example:

```text
Hello.

How are you?

I am fine.
```

Result:

```text
Turn Count = 3
```

---

## Average Words Per Turn

Formula:

```text
Average Words Per Turn
=
Word Count ÷ Turn Count
```

Rounded to:

```text
2 decimal places
```

