# Security Architecture

## Student Permissions

Can:

- View own data
- Edit own drafts

Cannot:

- Access other student submissions

---

## Teacher Permissions

Can:

- Access assigned classes

Cannot:

- Access other teachers' classes

---

## Administrator Permissions

Can:

- Access all system data

